`,wt(t.p,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"SWIFT"})," (",wt(t.em,{children:"Simple Weighted Intrinsic Feedback Technique"}),") learns a reward function directly from a task-performing LLM’s ",wt(t.strong,{children:"intrinsic signals"})," (hidden states or logits). This enables efficient ",wt(t.strong,{children:"Best-of-N"})," selection without relying on a massive text-based reward model."]}),`
`,wt(t.h2,{children:"Motivation"}),`
`,wt(t.p,{children:"Best-of-N sampling is typically bottlenecked by conventional reward models:"}),`
`,wt(t.ul,{children:[`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Massive"}),": often a fine-tuned LLM with billions of parameters."]}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Costly"}),": training and inference are GPU-heavy."]}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Data-hungry"}),": requires large-scale preference data."]}),`
`]}),`
`,wt(t.p,{children:"SWIFT bypasses these issues by mining the task LLM’s own internal signals."}),`
`,wt(t.h2,{children:"Method (high-level)"}),`
`,wt(t.ol,{children:[`
`,wt(t.li,{children:"For each generated token, extract hidden states from selected transformer layers (or use final logits in logits-only mode)."}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:"Feed token features into a lightweight linear reward model with gating mechanism."}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:"Aggregate token-level scores into a single reward for each candidate response, then select the best candidate in Best-of-N."}),`
`]}),`
`,wt(t.h2,{children:"Key Features"}),`
`,wt(t.ul,{children:[`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Extreme efficiency"}),": SWIFT is a lightweight reward model, using less than 0.005% of the parameters of typical RMs."]}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Strong performance"}),": competitive or better Best-of-N accuracy on standard benchmarks."]}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Data efficiency"}),": works well with only a few thousand training samples."]}),`
`,wt(t.li,{children:[wt(t.strong,{children:"Beyond reasoning"}),": applicable to preference-style objectives beyond reasoning (e.g., helpfulness and safety)."]}),`
`]}),`
`,wt(t.h2,{children:"Resources"}),`
`,wt(t.ul,{children:[`
